								<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem; border-right: 1px solid #cbd5e1; color: var(--accent-blue); font-weight: 700;">16 – 18 Músicas</td>
								<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;">90 – 115 BPM</td>
								<td style="padding: 0.6rem 0.8rem;">Bossa nova moderna, pop acústico, jazz leve, deep house sofisticado</td>
							</tr>
							<tr style="border-bottom: 1px solid #e2e8f0;">
